@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Upload a PCAP (replace the path with a real capture once you have one from data-generation/)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/analyses
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----X

------X
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.pcapng"
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

< ./data-generation/scenarios/clean_baseline.pcapng
------X--

### List analyses
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/analyses

### Run protocol identification (replace {{analysisId}} with the id from the upload response)
@analysisId = ana_REPLACE_ME
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/analyses/{{analysisId}}/run

### Get sessions found
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/analyses/{{analysisId}}/sessions

### Check status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/analyses/{{analysisId}}/status
